      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. Constitutional Framework"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "The Constitutional Framework defines the foundational structure of state governance and executive functioning.",
        "Haryana Civil Services (HCS) forms the executive arm responsible for administrative execution across state departments.",
        "Panchayati Raj in Haryana establishes rural local self-governance at the village, block, and district levels.",
        "Key State Legislations enact statutory provisions specifically catered to the administration and public welfare of Haryana."
      ],
      "id": "jm0npwl"
